### Bootstrap the first admin (public; gated by the shared secret in body)
# @name bootstrap
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/bootstrap
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "secret": "vC0bGxd14660a1a526P4eNz5L9hQ8fKq1",
  "firstName": "Jonathan",
  "lastName": "Bonzali",
  "phone": "233201994916",
  "email": "katbonzali@gmail.com"
}

### Add an admin / agent user (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Kofi",
  "lastName": "Agent",
  "phone": "233200000009",
  "role": "agent"
}

### List users (admin) — optional role filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### List users filtered by role
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?role=agent
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
